{"id": 4237, "title": "Attitude Determines the Future", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK4"], "slug": "attitude-determines-the-future", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/4237_attitude-determines-the-future.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["有三个工人正在砌墙。有人问他们：\"你们在干什么？”", "第一个人不耐烦地说：\"没看见吗？我在砌墙！”第二个人抬头苦笑着说：\"我们在盖一栋高楼。不过这份工作真是不轻松啊。”第三个人高兴地说：\"我们正在建设一座城市。我们现在所盖的这栋大楼未来将成为城市的标致性建筑之一啊！能参与这样一个工程，真是让人兴奋。”", "十年后，第一个人依然在砌墙；第二个人坐在办公室里画图纸——他成了工程师；第三个人，成了一家房地产公司的总裁,是前两个人的老板。", "态度决定未来,第三个工人对工作的热情以及认真态度，是他获得成功的关键。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["有三個工人正在砌牆。有人問他們：\"你們在幹什麼？”", "第一個人不耐煩地說：\"沒看見嗎？我在砌牆！”第二個人抬頭苦笑著說：\"我們在蓋一棟高樓。不過這份工作真是不輕鬆啊。”第三個人高興地說：\"我們正在建設一座城市。我們現在所蓋的這棟大樓未來將成為城市的標致性建築之一啊！能參與這樣一個工程，真是讓人興奮。”", "十年後，第一個人依然在砌牆；第二個人坐在辦公室裡畫圖紙——他成了工程師；第三個人，成了一家房地產公司的總裁,是前兩個人的老闆。", "態度決定未來,第三個工人對工作的熱情以及認真態度，是他獲得成功的關鍵。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["yǒu sān gè gōng rén zhèng zài qì qiáng。 yǒu rén wèn tā men：\" nǐ men zài gàn shén me？”", "dì yī gè rén bù nài fán de shuō：\" méi kàn jiàn ma？ wǒ zài qì qiáng！” dì èr gè rén tái tóu kǔ xiào zhe shuō：\" wǒ men zài gài yī dòng gāo lóu。 bù guò zhè fèn gōng zuò zhēn shì bù qīng sōng a。” dì sān gè rén gāo xìng de shuō：\" wǒ men zhèng zài jiàn shè yī zuò chéng shì。 wǒ men xiàn zài suǒ gài de zhè dòng dà lóu wèi lái jiāng chéng wéi chéng shì de biāo zhì xìng jiàn zhù zhī yī a！ néng cān yù zhè yàng yī gè gōng chéng， zhēn shì ràng rén xīng fèn。”", "shí nián hòu， dì yī gè rén yī rán zài qì qiáng； dì èr gè rén zuò zài bàn gōng shì lǐ huà tú zhǐ —— tā chéng le gōng chéng shī； dì sān gè rén， chéng le yī jiā fáng dì chǎn gōng sī de zǒng cái , shì qián liǎng gè rén de lǎo bǎn。", "tài dù jué dìng wèi lái , dì sān gè gōng rén duì gōng zuò de rè qíng yǐ jí rèn zhēn tài dù， shì tā huò dé chéng gōng de guān jiàn。"], "english_paragraphs": ["There are three workers building a wall. Someone asked them: \"What are you doing?\"", "The first person said impatiently: \"Don't you see? I'm building a wall!\" The second person looked up and said with a wry smile: \"We are building a high-rise building. But this job is really not easy.\" The third person said happily: \"We are building a city. The building we are building now will become one of the city's landmark buildings in the future! It is really exciting to be involved in such a project.\"", "Ten years later, the first person was still building walls; the second person was sitting in the office drawing drawings - he became an engineer; the third person became the president of a real estate company and was the boss of the first two people.", "Attitude determines the future. The third worker's enthusiasm and serious attitude towards work are the key to his success."], "english_full": "There are three workers building a wall. Someone asked them: \"What are you doing?\"\n\nThe first person said impatiently: \"Don't you see? I'm building a wall!\" The second person looked up and said with a wry smile: \"We are building a high-rise building. But this job is really not easy.\" The third person said happily: \"We are building a city. The building we are building now will become one of the city's landmark buildings in the future! It is really exciting to be involved in such a project.\"\n\nTen years later, the first person was still building walls; the second person was sitting in the office drawing drawings - he became an engineer; the third person became the president of a real estate company and was the boss of the first two people.\n\nAttitude determines the future. The third worker's enthusiasm and serious attitude towards work are the key to his success.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu\" data-defn=\"to have; there is\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"sān\" data-defn=\"three / 3\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">三</span><span class=\"tr\">三</span><rt>sān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general